</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.3.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.3.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T3.3.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:45.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T3.3.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T3.3.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Medical</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.3.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T3.3.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:150.8pt;">
<span id="A3.T3.3.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T3.3.12.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#606060;">However, oral metronidazole and tetracycline therapy continuously administered beginning 1</span><span id="A3.T3.3.12.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="A3.T3.3.12.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#006400;">day after surgery diminished hepatic injury (histology score 3.0 +/- 1.8</span><span id="A3.T3.3.12.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="A3.T3.3.12.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">and led to unexpected weight gain.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.3.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.3.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-bottom: 6.0pt;"></td>
