<span id="A3.T3.3.13.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:150.8pt;">
<span id="A3.T3.3.13.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T3.3.13.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">[GT: day after surgery diminished hepatic injury…]</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.3.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.3.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T3.3.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:45.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T3.3.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T3.3.14.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Financial</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.3.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T3.3.14.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:150.8pt;">
<span id="A3.T3.3.14.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T3.3.14.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#606060;">Dow, S&amp;P 500 and Nasdaq futures slipped between 0.7% and</span><span id="A3.T3.3.14.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="A3.T3.3.14.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#006400;">1% as the rise in bond yields weighed and Apple again fell 1.1% in pre-market trading ahead of earnings</span><span id="A3.T3.3.14.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="A3.T3.3.14.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">while Tesla rose on delivery optimism.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.3.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.3.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-bottom: 6.0pt;"></td>
