</span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.3.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T3.3.16.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:150.8pt;">
<span id="A3.T3.3.16.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T3.3.16.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#606060;">The 30-year bond US30YT=RR firmed 26/32, taking its yield to</span><span id="A3.T3.3.16.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="A3.T3.3.16.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#006400;">4.17 percent, after hitting another record low of 4.16 percent</span><span id="A3.T3.3.16.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="A3.T3.3.16.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">as investors fled into equities.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
