<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T3.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="A3.T3.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Example predicted continuations given a 10-token input prefix (<span id="A3.T3.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#606060;">grey</span>). <span id="A3.T3.14.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#006400;">Green</span> spans mark <math id="A3.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≥</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq</annotation></semantics></math>10-token verbatim copies; <span id="A3.T3.14.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">red</span> tokens show divergence. Square-bracketed lines give the Ground-Truth (GT) continuation for each divergent span.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
